      hu: ["A csúcs pontos magassága 7134 méter a tengerszint felett.", "A hegyet 1871-ben fedezte fel Alekszej Fedcsenko orosz utazó.", "Az első sikeres expedíciót 1928-ban vezették a csúcsra.", "Tadzsikisztán 2006-ban nevezte el Ibn Szína perzsa tudósról.", "A hegymászók szerint ez a legkönnyebb 7000-es csúcs a világon.", "1990-ben egy hatalmas lavina 43 hegymászót temetett maga alá a hegyen."],
      ro: ["Vârful are o înălțime de 7.134 de metri deasupra mării.", "Exploratorul rus Alexei Fedcenko a descoperit muntele în 1871.", "Prima atingere a vârfului a avut loc în anul 1928.", "Tadjikistanul a schimbat oficial numele în Ibn Sina în anul 2006.", "Este considerat cel mai puțin dificil vârf de peste 7.000 de metri.", "În 1990, o avalanșă masivă a provocat moartea a 43 de alpiniști."],
      en: ["The official elevation of the peak is 7,134 meters.", "It was discovered and mapped by Alexei Fedchenko in 1871.", "The first successful summit climb occurred in 1928.", "Tajikistan renamed the peak after Avicenna in 2006.", "It is often cited as the easiest 7,000m peak to climb technically.", "A catastrophic avalanche in 1990 claimed the lives of 43 climbers."],
